        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Allardice Castle, Cowie Castle, Dunnottar Castle, Fetteresso Castle, Muchalls Castle, Stonehaven, Aberdeenshire, Scotland, North Sea coast\n- Topics: coastal castles, ruined fortresses\n\nFacts:\n- Allardice Castle may be viewed as part of a chain of coastal castles.\n- North of Allardice Castle are Dunnottar Castle, Fetteresso Castle, Cowie Castle, and Muchalls Castle.\n- Dunnottar Castle is ruined.\n- Cowie Castle is ruined.\n- Cowie Castle is a ruined fortress in Aberdeenshire, Scotland.\n- Cowie Castle lies at the northern end of Stonehaven on the North Sea coast.",
